# NYC Live Music Events Finder - API Keys

# SeatGeek API (Required for real event data)
# Get free credentials at: https://seatgeek.com/account/develop
# Sign up, create an app, and copy both your client_id and client_secret
SEATGEEK_CLIENT_ID=your_seatgeek_client_id_here
SEATGEEK_CLIENT_SECRET=your_seatgeek_client_secret_here

# Note: Both client_id AND client_secret are required for SeatGeek API to work
